    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/b119b9393d13aecf72ffa1ddcd286ffb.avif?t=1753136024\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/5f644c4cdffc67820c5b6927226d8e56.avif?t=1753136024\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/ff8374639e3f628302e9c89756d5f245.poster.avif?t=1753136024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/ff8374639e3f628302e9c89756d5f245.webm?t=1753136024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>MORTARMEN</strong> is a movement based tactical PvP first and third person shooter based in 2030, pitting the <strong>New American Coalition</strong> versus <strong>United Communist Front</strong> in a battle for control, as part of an ongoing global space race war.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/d3c26c6b5b5e451c7f21a9ba583f2a48.poster.avif?t=1753136024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/d3c26c6b5b5e451c7f21a9ba583f2a48.webm?t=1753136024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>\u272a \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e  \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e High stakes genre blending arcade and tactical action<br>\u272a \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e  \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e Chainable movement mechanics: Slide, dodge roll, bunny hop, parachuting, and climbing<br>\u272a \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e  \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e Velocity based damage, higher the speed, higher the risk<br>\u272a \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e  \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e Portable mortars with mortar shell cameras<br>\u272a \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e  \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e Tactical tablet to equip weaponry, view satellite map, and HALO jump to sectors<br>\u272a \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e  \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e Varied island levels from small to large scale combat<br>\u272a \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e  \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e Take a gamble and feign your death<br>\u272a \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e  \u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e Stay out of outhouses<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/68cc519fc18cde6c81107951cbf1654a.webp?t=1753136024\" /></div><br>All soldiers are able to equip themselves with a portable mortar from their tablet, although skill levels vary, they're easy to use and <i>hard</i> to master. To better aid in target acquisition, cameras are attached to mortar shells until destroyed by impact. Their major role plays into denying sector control and keeping enemies at bay once they're honed in, communication is key to avoid any unforeseen consequences.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/ebd75cdaafc99d2587742caeafdaa63f.poster.avif?t=1753136024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/ebd75cdaafc99d2587742caeafdaa63f.webm?t=1753136024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/8823c7aec2144a99793622f13ebc68a3.webp?t=1753136024\" /></div><br>Factions battle it out on varied islands, all fighting for control of villages, outposts, and other points of interest in order to gain initiative to bleed the other team dry of reinforcements. Although any sector can be captured at any time, they must be linked to their factions' main base to gain any sector points; this gives opportunities for soldiers to break links of vital sectors to prevent the enemy team from maintaining initiative in the tug of war.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/9cd58d6f541a5ae1df4bf6fcc2ff68b7.avif?t=1753136024\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/cf9764ef48c8b9ea315d5f4df85ca044.poster.avif?t=1753136024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/cf9764ef48c8b9ea315d5f4df85ca044.webm?t=1753136024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/b764b2f036f06395ca4bf6bfeefc9dc8.webp?t=1753136024\" /></div><br><strong>New American Coalition</strong> is a combination task force between United States of America and Canada, their core objective is to capture territories across the world where presence of plutonium may have been sighted. Any trace of it will have the NAC calling, in order to further boost their space travel and technological advancements.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/6362f9e1316bfffa300f2c3c23db4058.avif?t=1753136024\" /></div><br><strong>United Communist Front</strong> is a merged Russian and Chinese alliance, begrudgingly working together to bolster their independent space agencies, they've already destroyed most of the competing satellites in low orbit, with their sights on space stations and beyond, they won't stop until they get a foothold above their adversaries and acquire further plutonium in this newly charged space race.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/65438ad93934a7480cf55dd3763ff9b1.poster.avif?t=1753136024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1310740/extras/65438ad93934a7480cf55dd3763ff9b1.webm?t=1753136024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join us for Weekly Play Sessions!</h2>Hop in Discord for maximum fun.",
